[TITLE]
Preissmann slot force-main model (issue #144)
A force main is full for the whole simulation, so under SURCHARGE_METHOD
SLOT the slot is active on every step -- the systematically affected case
for the conveyance-area change.  Exercises processForceMainLink().

Refactored engine only: legacy and the refactored engine have a large
PRE-EXISTING disagreement on force mains (14.4 ft of node depth under
plain EXTRAN, measured 2026-08-22), unrelated to issue #144, so this
model cannot be used for a cross-engine tolerance comparison.
Two 1-ft circular pipes forced far past capacity so the slot is active for
most of the run. Deep junctions keep the water in the slot instead of
flooding it away, which is what exercises the momentum terms.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
SURCHARGE_METHOD     SLOT
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0
ALLOW_PONDING        NO
SKIP_STEADY_STATE    NO
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             04:00:00
SWEEP_START          01/01
SWEEP_END            12/31
DRY_DAYS             0
REPORT_STEP          00:01:00
WET_STEP             00:01:00
DRY_STEP             00:01:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:05
INERTIAL_DAMPING     PARTIAL
NORMAL_FLOW_LIMITED  BOTH
FORCE_MAIN_EQUATION  H-W
VARIABLE_STEP        0.75
LENGTHENING_STEP     0
MIN_SURFAREA         12.557
MAX_TRIALS           8
HEAD_TOLERANCE       0.005
SYS_FLOW_TOL         5
LAT_FLOW_TOL         5

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT   0.0
DRY_ONLY   NO

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev   MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J1       100    30        0          0         0
J2       99.5   30        0          0         0
J3       99.0   30        0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev   Type   Stage  Gated
OUT      98.0   FREE          NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  From  To    Length  Roughness  InOff  OutOff  InitFlow  MaxFlow
C1       J1    J2    400     0.015      0      0       0         0
C2       J2    J3    400     0.015      0      0       0         0
C3       J3    OUT   400     0.015      0      0       0         0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1       FORCE_MAIN  1.0    130      0      0      1
C2       FORCE_MAIN  1.0    130      0      0      1
C3       FORCE_MAIN  1.0    130      0      0      1
[INFLOWS]
;;Node  Constituent  TimeSeries  Type  Mfactor  Sfactor  Baseline
J1       FLOW         SURGE       FLOW  1.0      1.0

[TIMESERIES]
;;Name  Date        Time   Value
SURGE               0:00   0.0
SURGE               0:10   12.0
SURGE               2:30   12.0
SURGE               3:00   0.0
SURGE               4:00   0.0

[REPORT]
INPUT      NO
CONTROLS   NO
SUBCATCHMENTS ALL
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL

[TAGS]

[MAP]
DIMENSIONS 0.000 0.000 1000.000 1000.000
Units      None

[COORDINATES]
;;Node  X       Y
J1       100     500
J2       400     500
J3       700     500
OUT      1000    500
